ecause:\n- You\u2019ve been discarding character tiles consistently (W1, W2, W3, W6).\n- No player has shown any interest in character suit.\n- W4 is not a terminal or dragon, and not related to prevalent/seat winds (East/North).\n- Other options like B4, B5, B2 involve dots, which you have more of \u2014 possibly building around B2/B4/B8, which could support Middle Tiles or Full Flush if developed.\n- T7 and T3 are safer than most, but T3 is duplicated and might be useful for you later.\n\nThus, **W4** is the safest discard with minimal risk of helping opponents.\n\nAnswer: Play W4"}
